,"html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"11"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in\\mathbf2^*\">\\(w\\in\\mathbf2^*\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_H(w)\\in\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\chi_H(w)\\in\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> 由下式定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 为定理中存在的随机机。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\chi_H(w)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1,&amp;w\\in\\{0\\}^+\\cup\\{1\\}^+,\\\\0,&amp;w\\notin\\{0\\}^+\\cup\\{1\\}^+.\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\chi_H(w)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1,&amp;w\\in\\{0\\}^+\\cup\\{1\\}^+,\\\\0,&amp;w\\notin\\{0\\}^+\\cup\\{1\\}^+.\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists M\\in\\mathsf{RPoly}\\;\\bigl[\\Pr_M^a(\\varepsilon)=0\\land\n\\forall w\\in\\mathbf2^+\\;\\Pr_M^a(w)=\\tfrac12\\chi_H(w)+2^{-(|w|+1)}\n\\land\\neg\\exists L\\subseteq\\mathbf2^*\\;\\operatorname{RPRec}(M,L)\\bigr].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists M\\in\\mathsf{RPoly}\\;\\bigl[\\Pr_M^a(\\varepsilon)=0\\land\n\\forall w\\in\\mathbf2^+\\;\\Pr_M^a(w)=\\tfrac12\\chi_H(w)+2^{-(|w|+1)}\n\\land\\neg\\exists L\\subseteq\\mathbf2^*\\;\\operatorname{RPRec}(M,L)\\bigr].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>先掷一位：0 分支检验非空输入是否全同；1 分支逐位和新随机位比较。混合输入 001 的接受概率为 1/16，既不是 0，也不足 1/2，故该机器不能按 RP 规则识别任何语言。不能据此推断某个相关语言本身不在 RP。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-random-polynomial-time-and-rp","status":"resolved","id":"1c185b4536ca59db","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-random-polynomial-time-and-rp]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"w\\in\\mathbf2^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_H(w)\\in\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_H(w)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1,&w\\in\\{0\\}^+\\cup\\{1\\}^+,\\\\0,&w\\notin\\{0\\}^+\\cup\\{1\\}^+.\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"\\exists M\\in\\mathsf{RPoly}\\;\\bigl[\\Pr_M^a(\\varepsilon)=0\\land\n\\forall w\\in\\mathbf2^+\\;\\Pr_M^a(w)=\\tfrac12\\chi_H(w)+2^{-(|w|+1)}\n\\land\\neg\\exists L\\subseteq\\mathbf2^*\\;\\operatorname{RPRec}(M,L)\\bigr].","display":true}],"bytes":1562,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-333","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-ex-random-machine-probability-gap|多项式随机机未必满足 RP 的概率间隙]] （本轮新建）"}],"outgoing":["1c185b4536ca59db"]}